    ƒ (x)  =  -------------------  =  ---------- x  -  ----- x^-1  =  (10 / 165) x^1  +  0 x^0  +  (34 / 3) x^-1        //  Its leading coefficient is:  10 / 165.
                    15 / 10            11 * 1.5         1.5                                                             //  Its constant term is:  0.

